<title>JAPAN: Senshukai to repurchase up to 2 mln shares.</title>
<headline>Senshukai to repurchase up to 2 mln shares.</headline>
<dateline>OSAKA 1997-05-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Senshukai Co Ltd said on Friday that it would buy back up to two million of its shares and alter company regulations in order to expedite the repurchase.  </p>
<p>Senshukai is a major Japanese catalog and mail-order retailer.</p>
</text>
